lex flex-col gap-2.5"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4"><h3 class="display text-[1.3rem] md:text-[1.5rem]">Editorial</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right size-4 shrink-0 text-ink/35 transition-all duration-500 ease-dentea group-hover/tech:translate-x-0.5 group-hover/tech:-translate-y-0.5 group-hover/tech:text-ink" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></div><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink/70">Monographs, lookbooks and magazines with layouts built from the identity’s own grid, so long reads still feel like the brand.</p></div></a><a class="group/tech flex flex-col gap-5" href="/touchpoints/digital-product"><div class="relative aspect-4/3 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-ink/8"><img src="/images/work/mono-phones.jpg" alt="MONO app screens on two phones" loading="lazy" decoding="async" draggable="false" class="block object-cover object-center absolute inset-0 size-full transition-transform duration-700 ease-dentea group-hover/tech:scale-105"/></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4"><h3 class="display text-[1.3rem] md:text-[1.5rem]">Digital Product</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right size-4 shrink-0 text-ink/35 transition-all duration-500 ease-dentea group-hover/tech:translate-x-0.5 group-hover/tech:-translate-y-0.5 group-hover/tech:text-ink" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></div><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink/70">Apps, product interfaces and websites that carry the identity onto screens while staying clear enough to use every day.</p></div></a><a class="group/tech flex flex-col gap-5" href="/touchpoints/apparel-and-goods"><div class="relative aspect-4/3 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-ink/8"><img src="/images/work/vanta-hoodie.jpg" alt="VANTA wordmark embroidered on a black hoodie" loading="lazy" decoding="async" draggable="false" class="block object-cover object-center absolute inset-0 size-full transition-transform duration-700 ease-dentea group-hover/tech:scale-105"/></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4"><h3 class="display text-[1.3rem] md:text-[1.5rem]">Apparel and Goods</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right size-4 shrink-0 text-ink/35 transition-all duration-500 ease-dentea group-hover/tech:translate-x-0.5 group-hover/tech:-translate-y-0.5 group-hover/tech:text-ink" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></div><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink/70">Uniforms, merchandise, tags and labels, where the mark is often embroidered or pressed rather than printed.</p></div></a></div></div></section>
